<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-S.AFRICA 240-3 AT CLOSE OF SECOND DAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-S.AFRICA 240-3 AT CLOSE OF SECOND DAY.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 240 for three at the close of play on the second day of the third and final cricket test match against Australia at Centurion Park on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 227, South Africa 240-3, 90 overs (Adam Bacher 94 not out, Brian McMillan 55).</p>
